<view class="page"><view class="hero"><view class="title">OCD 工具箱</view><view class="subtitle">把困扰拆成一小步，陪你练习与记录。</view></view><view class="tool-card" bindtap="goAssess"><view class="emoji">🧭</view><view><view class="card-title">OCD 自评</view><view class="card-desc">简化版或详细版，自助观察，不是诊断</view></view><view class="arrow">›</view></view><view class="tool-card" bindtap="goExposure"><view class="emoji">🪜</view><view><view class="card-title">暴露阶梯</view><view class="card-desc">从可承受的小步开始，练习反应阻止</view></view><view class="arrow">›</view></view><view class="tool-card" bindtap="goLog"><view class="emoji">📝</view><view><view class="card-title">症状日志</view><view class="card-desc">记录触发、 SUDS 和这次是否忍住</view></view><view class="arrow">›</view></view><view class="summary"><view class="section">本周概览</view><view class="summary-row"><view><view class="number">{{stats ? stats.count : '—'}}</view><view>记录数</view></view><view><view class="number">{{stats ? stats.averageSudsDrop : '—'}}</view><view>平均 SUDS 下降</view></view><view><view class="number">{{stepProgress.completed}} / {{stepProgress.total}}</view><view>完成阶梯</view></view></view><view class="top" wx:if="{{stats && stats.topTriggers.length}}">常见触发：{{stats.topTriggers[0].trigger}}</view></view><view class="notice">这些工具用于自我观察和练习，不做诊断；如果症状持续影响生活，建议寻求精神科或心理科评估。</view><view class="error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view></view>
